## Notes: Standalone buff and debuff bar replacing Blizzard's (and pfUI's) own player buff frame - sorts and color-codes buffs by who gave them to you (which class), weapon enchants, world buffs, consumables, and racials instead of raw aura order; debuffs get their own bar color-coded by dispel type. Styled after pfUI (bundled assets, not a live dependency) with full manual control over font/size/borders/layout.
